{"data":{"id":"10.5281/zenodo.24088563","type":"dois","attributes":{"doi":"10.5281/zenodo.24088563","prefix":"10.5281","suffix":"zenodo.24088563","identifiers":[{"identifier":"oai:zenodo.org:24088563","identifierType":"oai"}],"alternateIdentifiers":[{"alternateIdentifierType":"oai","alternateIdentifier":"oai:zenodo.org:24088563"}],"creators":[{"name":"Vale, Dorian","nameType":"Personal","givenName":"Dorian","familyName":"Vale","affiliation":["Museum of One"],"nameIdentifiers":[{"nameIdentifier":"0009-0004-7737-5094","nameIdentifierScheme":"ORCID"}]}],"titles":[{"title":"Relational Archival Investigation: Identity, Chronology, and Historical Judgment in Korean Experimental Art"}],"publisher":"Museum of One","container":{},"publicationYear":2026,"subjects":[{"subject":"Relational Archival Investigation"},{"subject":"art historiography"},{"subject":"Korean experimental art"},{"subject":"source criticism"},{"subject":"historical identification"},{"subject":"chronology"},{"subject":"performance documentation"},{"subject":"Post-Interpretive Criticism"},{"subject":"한국 실험미술"},{"subject":"Korean art"},{"subject":"Korean art history"},{"subject":"Art archives"},{"subject":"Exhibition history"},{"subject":"Museum collection records"},{"subject":"한국미술"},{"subject":"한국미술사"},{"subject":"미술 아카이브"},{"subject":"국립현대미술관"},{"subject":"서울시립 미술아카이브"},{"subject":"Lee Kang-so"},{"subject":"이강소"},{"subject":"Park Suk-won"},{"subject":"박석원"},{"subject":"Sung Neung Kyung"},{"subject":"성능경"},{"subject":"Kim Youngjin"},{"subject":"김영진"},{"subject":"Kim Yong-Ik"},{"subject":"김용익"},{"subject":"Rim Dong Sik"},{"subject":"임동식"},{"subject":"Museum of One"},{"subject":"Dorian Vale"}],"contributors":[],"dates":[{"date":"2026-11-09","dateType":"Issued"}],"language":"en","types":{"ris":"RPRT","bibtex":"article","citeproc":"article-journal","schemaOrg":"ScholarlyArticle","resourceType":"Working paper","resourceTypeGeneral":"Text"},"relatedIdentifiers":[{"relationType":"IsSupplementedBy","relatedIdentifier":"10.5281/zenodo.24088574","resourceTypeGeneral":"Text","relatedIdentifierType":"DOI"},{"relationType":"IsSupplementedBy","relatedIdentifier":"10.5281/zenodo.24088573","resourceTypeGeneral":"Text","relatedIdentifierType":"DOI"},{"relationType":"IsDescribedBy","relatedIdentifier":"https://www.museumofone.art/rai-identity-chronology-korean-experimental-art/","resourceTypeGeneral":"Text","relatedIdentifierType":"URL"},{"relationType":"IsDescribedBy","relatedIdentifier":"https://hal.science/hal-05858135","resourceTypeGeneral":"Text","relatedIdentifierType":"URL"},{"relationType":"IsCitedBy","relatedIdentifier":"10.5281/zenodo.24095953","resourceTypeGeneral":"Text","relatedIdentifierType":"DOI"},{"relationType":"IsCitedBy","relatedIdentifier":"10.5281/zenodo.24095308","resourceTypeGeneral":"Text","relatedIdentifierType":"DOI"},{"relationType":"IsIdenticalTo","relatedIdentifier":"https://osf.io/zhnre/files/wrbkx","resourceTypeGeneral":"Text","relatedIdentifierType":"URL"},{"relationType":"IsDescribedBy","relatedIdentifier":"https://philarchive.org/rec/VALRAI","resourceTypeGeneral":"Other","relatedIdentifierType":"URL"},{"relationType":"IsDescribedBy","relatedIdentifier":"https://archive.museumofone.art/items/24088563.html","resourceTypeGeneral":"Other","relatedIdentifierType":"URL"},{"relationType":"IsReferencedBy","relatedIdentifier":"https://www.museumofone.art/relational-archival-investigation/","resourceTypeGeneral":"Other","relatedIdentifierType":"URL"},{"relationType":"IsVersionOf","relatedIdentifier":"10.5281/zenodo.24088562","relatedIdentifierType":"DOI"}],"relatedItems":[],"sizes":[],"formats":[],"version":"1.0","rightsList":[{"rights":"In Copyright"},{"rights":"© 2026 Dorian Vale · Museum of One","rightsUri":"http://rightsstatements.org/vocab/InC/1.0/"}],"descriptions":[{"description":"This study in Korean art history examines how museum collections and art archives support claims about Korean experimental art. Relational Archival Investigation (RAI) compares seven consecutive acquisition entries from the National Museum of Modern and Contemporary Art, Korea (MMCA), 2016 Annual Report with collection records 7922–7928. Two leading production-year assignments differ. Lee Kang-so’s published account distinguishes production from presentation for Painting–78–1. The discrepancy for Park Suk-won’s Jeok–Eungnyeok remains open. Further cases examine Sung Neung Kyung’s Reading Newspaper, Kim Youngjin’s 1978–2, Kim Yong-Ik’s Flat Object title history and Rim Dong Sik’s later repair of a performance photograph. The study separates what records identify from what they establish about a work’s production, naming, performance, exhibition and documentation. The seven-entry comparison is bounded and was selected retrospectively. Post-Interpretive Criticism provides the philosophical background.\n\n한국어 초록한국 실험미술의 작품 식별과 연대, 전시 및 기록의 관계를 살핀 연구다. 국립현대미술관(MMCA)의 2016년 연보 소장품 수집 목록 73–79번과 소장품 기록 7922–7928을 대조한다. 두 사례에서 제작연도가 다르게 제시된다. 이강소의 공개된 대담은 〈페인팅-78-1〉의 제작과 발표를 구분하는 근거를 제공하며, 박석원의 〈적-응력〉 연대 차이는 미해결로 남는다. 성능경, 김영진, 김용익, 임동식의 사례에서는 작품명과 전시, 퍼포먼스, 사진 기록이 가리키는 서로 다른 사건을 살핀다.\n\nArtists in this studyLee Kang-so (이강소; Lee Kangso, Lee Kang So) · Park Suk-won (박석원; Park Suk Won) · Sung Neung Kyung (성능경; Sung Neungkyung) · Kim Youngjin (김영진; KIM Youngjin b, 김영진 b) · Kim Yong-Ik (김용익; Kim Yong Ik) · Rim Dong Sik (임동식; Rim Dongsik)\n\nWorks discussedPainting–78–1 (페인팅-78-1) · Jeok–Eungnyeok (적-응력) · Untitled 75031 (무제 75031) · Reading Newspaper (신문 읽기) · 1978–2 · Flat Object (평면 오브제) · Tying Reeds and Beard (갈대와 수염 묶기)\n\nDorian Vale, Museum of One, 2026. ORCID 0009-0004-7737-5094. Version 1.0. © 2026 Dorian Vale · Museum of One.\n\nAuthor and publisher authority recordsDorian Vale | ORCID 0009-0004-7737-5094 | Wikidata Q136308916 | ISNI 0000000528819744 (publisher-attested)Museum of One | Wikidata Q136308879 | ISNI 0000000528819728 (publisher-attested)\n\nResearch context and responsibility. This working paper develops Relational Archival Investigation as a source-critical research method, with Post-Interpretive Criticism as its philosophical background, within the Institutional and Archival Investigations research area at Museum of One. Dorian Vale is the sole author, affiliated with Museum of One, which is also the publisher. MMCA, SeMA and other cited museums and archives are documentary sources or research subjects, not author affiliations or funders. The documentary supplement and extended case studies are separately titled and separately citable companion works; they are not new versions of this paper. The seven-entry comparison is bounded and retrospectively selected.","descriptionType":"Abstract"}],"geoLocations":[],"fundingReferences":[],"xml":"","url":"https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.24088563","contentUrl":null,"metadataVersion":3,"schemaVersion":"http://datacite.org/schema/kernel-4","source":"api","isActive":true,"state":"findable","reason":null,"viewCount":0,"viewsOverTime":[],"downloadCount":0,"downloadsOverTime":[],"referenceCount":4,"citationCount":5,"citationsOverTime":[{"year":"2026","total":5}],"partCount":0,"partOfCount":0,"versionCount":0,"versionOfCount":1,"created":"2026-11-09T16:22:48.000Z","registered":"2026-11-09T16:22:48.000Z","published":"2026","updated":"2026-11-11T14:17:25.000Z"},"relationships":{"client":{"data":{"id":"cern.zenodo","type":"clients"}},"provider":{"data":{"id":"cern","type":"providers"}},"media":{"data":{"id":"10.5281/zenodo.24088563","type":"media"}},"references":{"data":[{"id":"10.5281/zenodo.24088573","type":"dois"},{"id":"10.5281/zenodo.24088574","type":"dois"},{"id":"10.5281/zenodo.24088571","type":"dois"},{"id":"10.5281/zenodo.24088572","type":"dois"}]},"citations":{"data":[{"id":"10.5281/zenodo.24095308","type":"dois"},{"id":"10.5281/zenodo.24095953","type":"dois"},{"id":"10.5281/zenodo.24093528","type":"dois"},{"id":"10.5281/zenodo.24095952","type":"dois"},{"id":"10.5281/zenodo.24093529","type":"dois"}]},"parts":{"data":[]},"partOf":{"data":[]},